  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2070847946}
  m_Text: 'The lift is stuck: it''s overloaded and

    its counterweight is adrift.

    B:
    steer the heavy crate off the lift

    and the counterweight over the tray (the

    shaft
    is weightless). A: restore gravity

    to set them down.'
